{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1787443881249851002,"compiled_state":{"alias":"dendritic-taxidermic-lovebird","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"61a8c0424e78ad7fa8eefb0237eeeb8ac22c2dc2e76664db957d44bd4b6d1cee","event_uuid":"f36a34b2-c746-455d-94ab-61b722310452","position":{"commit_sha":"04f507906204d977c4d43dde460dc8e0a6a6a769","position":"1787443763836331001-f36a34b2-c746-455d-94ab-61b722310452"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"d57c852982c83f8ddc4970638482408a1995a544d2ea405b7be7ce12e199aa68","event_uuid":"0b25f7ed-2bc6-4093-afd6-840786e66a40","position":{"commit_sha":"abf2c6ded2cfd84751dac8f6e09ddc98407009ad","position":"1787443881249851001-0b25f7ed-2bc6-4093-afd6-840786e66a40"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1787443763836331001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"0b25f7ed-2bc6-4093-afd6-840786e66a40","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"a3f5-5c19-faad-417b"}],"description":"Sibling of bug a3f5-5c19-faad-417b (found in its Step-7 construct sweep); same class as 3d57-602f-0b75-48ee.\n\nMechanism: orchestrator.delivered_children_manifest (src/rebar/llm/plan_review/orchestrator.py:~151) loops a container's children and calls attest.delivered_now -> _attested_delivered -> compute_validity(sig, child, 'completion-verifier') per closed child; the completion branch recomputes current_material_fingerprint (1 full-store reduce via live_material_children) and on mismatch retries 3 legacy generations — O(N)..O(4N)+ full-store scans per Pass-2 completion sub-call manifest assembly. It also does a per-child full show_ticket read (separate, lighter concern).\n\nProposed fix (same remedy shape as 3d57 / a3f5): open 'with material_child_index(repo_root=repo_root):' around the delivered_now loop in delivered_children_manifest so every child fingerprint answers from one shared snapshot. Counting-seam regression test template: tests/unit/test_completion_child_gate_scan_count.py.\n\nAcceptance criteria:\n- [ ] Full-store reduce count during delivered_children_manifest does not grow with child count (counting-seam test).\n- [ ] Delivered manifest contents byte-identical before/after on a fixture store.\n- [ ] make lint + typecheck + complexity ratchet clean.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"bb3a-c931-47ba-4808","ticket_type":"bug","title":"delivered-children manifest scans full store per child (delivered_now)","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["f36a34b2-c746-455d-94ab-61b722310452","0b25f7ed-2bc6-4093-afd6-840786e66a40"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787443881249851002,"uuid":"ee98713b-ef0e-4375-83ff-93e60ed7aa1c"}